    [3429]={name="Guardsman Belt",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Jailor Eston.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",npc="Jailor Eston"},
    [3431]={name="Bone-studded Leather",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=19,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Missing In Action'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Keeshan in Redridge Mountains. Objective: Protect Corporal Keeshan on the journey back to Redridge.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Missing In Action",lore="At last, friends of the Alliance! Help... please... The last thing I remember these foul Orcs overpowered our regiment. Most the men were killed."},
    [3440]={name="Bonecracker",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Family Crypt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magistrate Sevren in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Kill 8 Wailing Ancestors and 8 Rotting Ancestors.Kill Captain Dargol, and bring his skull to Magistrate Sevren in Brill.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="The Family Crypt",lore="The Agamand Mills area has become a foothold for the Scourge. Their strongest point is the Agamand Family Crypt where their local military leader, a skeleton named Captain Dargol, has headquartered."},
    [3444]={name="Tiller's Vest",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: Maggot Eye'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Kill Maggot Eye and return to Executor Zygand in Brill with his paw for a reward.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Wanted: Maggot Eye",lore="Wanted: Maggot Eye! A foul beast, even by Gnoll standards, Maggot Eye has been sentenced to death for his crimes against The Forsaken. This despicable villain has been stealing corpses for use by the Lich King's army."},
    [3449]={name="Mystic Shawl",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Pyrewood Ambush'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Deathstalker Faerleia in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Help Deathstalker Faerleia kill the Pyrewood Council.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Pyrewood Ambush",lore="You got here just in the nick of time! The Pyrewood Council will be returning any moment. Arugal has other matters to tend to in the keep. He uses the Council as mere puppets to keep the mindless minions of Pyrewood under his control."},
    [3451]={name="Nightglow Concoction",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Recipe For Death'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Renferrel in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="A Recipe For Death",lore="According to Berard's Journal the moss from Lake Skulkers and Creepers might prove useful for our quest to brew a new plague. Those beasts dwell on the islands in Lake Lordamere to the east."},
    [3452]={name="Ceranium Rod",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Weaver'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shadow Priest Allister in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="The Weaver",lore="An archmage of great power is overseeing the reactivation of the ley energy node. With the progress they have made, our only hope of stopping them is by killing him."},
    [3454]={name="Reconnaissance Boots",quality=1,ilvl=14,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Dead Fields'. Starts with High Executor Hadrec in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Kill rot hide gnolls at the Dead Fields.When Nightlash appears, kill her.Bring the Essence of Nightlash to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="The Dead Fields",lore="Our initial scouting reports of Silverpine show the rot hides have a base at an old farm to the north, the Dead Fields."},
    [3456]={name="Dog Whistle",quality=3,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Houndmaster Loksey.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",npc="Houndmaster Loksey",proc="Use: Summons a tracking hound that will protect you for 3 min. (10 Min Cooldown)"},
    [3457]={name="Stamped Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wand to Bethor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Undercity. Objective: Take the Woven Wand to Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Wand to Bethor",lore="Thule once told me that, long ago, he and two colleagues created a magic wand, woven together from the apprentice wands each mage possessed."},
    [3461]={name="High Robe of the Adjudicator",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Assault on Fenris Isle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with High Executor Hadrec in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring Thule's Head to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Assault on Fenris Isle",lore="Now is the time to assault the Scourge's place of strength in Silverpine: Fenris Isle. You must again go to the Isle and destroy Thule Ravenclaw."},
    [3511]={name="Cloak of the People's Militia",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Red Leather Bandanas'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Scout Galiaan in Westfall. Objective: Bring 15 Red Leather Bandanas to Scout Galiaan at Sentinel Hill.",zone="Westfall",questName="Red Leather Bandanas",lore="The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."},
    [3555]={name="Robe of Solomon",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=19,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Missing In Action'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Keeshan in Redridge Mountains. Objective: Protect Corporal Keeshan on the journey back to Redridge.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Missing In Action",lore="At last, friends of the Alliance! Help... please... The last thing I remember these foul Orcs overpowered our regiment. Most the men were killed."},
    [3560]={name="Mantle of Honor",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bride of the Embalmer'. Starts with Lord Ello Ebonlocke in Duskwood. Objective: Find Eliza's grave. Retrieve the Embalmer's Heart from her, then return to Ello Ebonlocke.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Bride of the Embalmer",lore="The Embalmer is a name told in one of our children's stories. He was a kindly alchemist, driven mad by the death of his wife, Eliza. To restore her, he used dark magic to place his own heart within the bosom of his dead spouse."},
    [3561]={name="Resilient Poncho",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Apprentice's Duties'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with James Halloran in Wetlands. Objective: Collect 6 Giant Crocolisk Skins and bring them to James Halloran in Menethil Harbor.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Apprentice's Duties",lore="I sent my apprentice out into the marshes to skin some of our famous giant Wetlands crocolisks. When he didn't return, I went out to look for him..."},
    [3562]={name="Belt of Vindication",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fury Runs Deep'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Motley Garmason in Wetlands. Objective: Motley Garmason wants Kam Deepfury's head brought to him at Dun Modr.",zone="The Stockade",questName="The Fury Runs Deep",lore="You have proven your loyalty to King Magni. And your hatred for the Dark Iron scum is as great as my own. There is a task I wish to complete myself but I am bound by honor to stay with Longbraid."},
    [3563]={name="Seafarer's Pantaloons",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Large Loch Crocolisk.",zone="Loch Modan",npc="Large Loch Crocolisk"},
    [3566]={name="Raptorbane Armor",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ormer's Revenge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ormer Ironbraid in Wetlands. Objective: Ormer Ironbraid at the Whelgar Excavation Site wants you to kill Sarltooth and return to him with one of his talons once the task is fulfilled.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Ormer's Revenge",lore="While you were down there I happened to notice that one of those beasts stood out from the rest. He was bigger and more menacing. I bet he's the one who led the others here to cause the disruption to the dig site."},
    [3569]={name="Vicar's Robe",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=21,sourceType="raid_trash",instructions="Drops from Death's Head Priest.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Death's Head Priest"},
    [3570]={name="Bonegrinding Pestle",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arugal's Folly'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dalar Dawnweaver in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 Worgen Bits to Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
    [3571]={name="Trogg Beater",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Magosh.",zone="Loch Modan",npc="Magosh"},
    [3578]={name="Harvester's Pants",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Killing Fields'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Farmer Saldean in Westfall. Objective: Farmer Saldean wants you to kill 20 Harvest Watchers.",zone="Westfall",questName="The Killing Fields",lore="Look at what has happened to this place! These lands were once occupied by good farm folk. But the damned thieves have driven them all off. Not me, though!"},
    [3582]={name="Acidproof Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Recipe For Death'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Renferrel in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="A Recipe For Death",lore="According to Berard's Journal the moss from Lake Skulkers and Creepers might prove useful for our quest to brew a new plague. Those beasts dwell on the islands in Lake Lordamere to the east."},
    [3583]={name="Weathered Belt",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ivar the Foul'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rane Yorick in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Kill Ivar the Foul, and bring Ivar's Head to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Ivar the Foul",lore="My brother Quinn and I were tasked to recon Silverpine Forest and report to High Executor Hadrec. But we didn't get far -- when moving through this farm we were attacked by the ghoul Ivar the Foul."},
    [3585]={name="Camouflaged Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Weaver'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shadow Priest Allister in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="The Weaver",lore="An archmage of great power is overseeing the reactivation of the ley energy node. With the progress they have made, our only hope of stopping them is by killing him."},
    [3587]={name="Embroidered Belt",quality=1,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Qixdi Goodstitch.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",npc="Qixdi Goodstitch"},
