    [4861]={name="Sleek Feathered Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Mazzranache.",zone="Mulgore",npc="Mazzranache"},
    [4909]={name="Kodo Hunter's Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rites of the Earthmother'. Starts with Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff wants you to bring him the Horn of Arra'chea.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rites of the Earthmother",lore="We are hunters. Down below in Mulgore there is a mighty kodo named Arra'chea."},
    [4940]={name="Veiled Grips",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zalazane'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Master Gadrin in Durotar. Objective: Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin.",zone="Durotar",questName="Zalazane",lore="The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."},
    [4942]={name="Tiger Hide Boots",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Storms'. Starts with Orgnil Soulscar in Durotar. Objective: Bring Fizzle's Claw to Orgnil Soulscar in Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Dark Storms",lore="We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar! We must destroy them before their evil festers!"},
    [4944]={name="Handsewn Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Lost But Not Forgotten'. Starts with Misha Tor'kren in Durotar. Objective: Bring a sign of Kron's fate to Misha Tor'kren at the farmstead northwest of Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Lost But Not Forgotten",lore="please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [4964]={name="Goblin Smasher",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supervisor Fizsprocket'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Morin Cloudstalker in Mulgore. Objective: Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Supervisor Fizsprocket",lore="According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."},
    [4968]={name="Bound Harness",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Preparation for Ceremony'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Preparation for Ceremony",lore="my brother soon stands before Chief Bloodhoof, and it is my honor to make his headdress for him. I want to ask a favor of you while I finish tanning these leather straps."},
    [4970]={name="Rough-hewn Kodo Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dwarven Digging'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Baine Bloodhoof in Mulgore. Objective: Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Dwarven Digging",lore="There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."},
    [4973]={name="Plains Hunter Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazzranache'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Raincaller in Mulgore. Objective: Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Mazzranache",lore="He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite. As fortune would have it, while traveling across the plains, I encountered it, and it took a nasty bite from my shoulder."},
    [4976]={name="Mistspray Kilt",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Real Threat'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korin Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Slay Or'Kalar and bring his Head to Korin Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="The Real Threat",lore="You serve my husband well, but he does not know why Hammerfall is under attack. Or'Kalar, Mug'thol's pawn in Stromgarde, has an intense hatred for my husband, and wishes nothing more than my husband's death for defeating him years ago."},
    [4979]={name="Enchanted Stonecloth Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stone Is Better than Cloth'. Starts with Lucien Tosselwrench in Badlands. Objective: Bring some Patterned Bronze Bracers to Lucien Tosselwrench in the Badlands.",zone="Badlands",questName="Stone Is Better than Cloth",lore="Maybe it'll even help protect you from the coming atrocity that is Lotwil's newest invention. I've been working with all the extra stones you collected for him, and I can make some nice bracers that you might want to use."},
    [4980]={name="Prospector Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Agmond's Fate'.",zone="Uldaman",questName="Agmond's Fate",lore="The last report I received from Agmond is troubling, more so now that he's dead! He mentioned that his diggers uncovered \"ancient urns\" at the dig site outside Uldaman."},
    [4983]={name="Rock Pulverizer",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Murdaloc'. The quest is in Badlands. Objective: Slay Agmond's killer, Murdaloc.Slay 12 Stonevault Bonesnappers.Report to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan.",zone="Badlands",questName="Murdaloc",lore="Agmond's tracks lead from the west. It is easy to tell from the bloody smears across rock and sand that the dwarf crawled some distance."},
    [4984]={name="Skull of Impending Doom",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Forbidden Knowledge'.",zone="Badlands",questName="Forbidden Knowledge",lore="I have the digest for you. I need not tell you to take great care with it. And to keep it far from unfriendly hands. This book holds many truths......And the truth can burn.",proc="Use: Increase your run speed by 60% for 10 sec, but deals 100 to 500 damage and drains 100 to 500 mana every 2 seconds. (5 Min Cooldown)"},
